  "task_assistant_messages": [
    "1. Sunny sold **12 boxes on Saturday**.\n2. The number of boxes sold on Sunday is not given.\n3. Therefore, the total number sold over the weekend **cannot be determined**.\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{\\text{Cannot be determined from the information given}}\n\\]",
    "We know Sunny sold **10 boxes on Saturday**, but the number sold on Sunday is not provided. Therefore, the weekend total cannot be determined.\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{\\text{Cannot be determined}}\n\\]",
    "Sunny sold **10 boxes** on Saturday. Since each customer bought **2 boxes**, that means:\n\n\\[\n10 \\div 2 = 5 \\text{ customers}\n\\]\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{10\\text{ boxes}}\n\\]",
    "Sunny sold:\n\n- **10 boxes** on Saturday\n- **16 boxes** on Sunday\n\nSo the total number of boxes sold over the weekend was:\n\n\\[\n10+16=26\n\\]\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{26\\text{ boxes}}\n\\]",
